      "stale_hits": [],
      "global_stale_hits": [],
      "answer": "TL;DR: The Shepherds (Shepherd\u2019s Flock) are a recruiting cult-like protest movement aligned with and serving Maelthor, whom they view as a purifying power shaping the world.\n\nThe **Shepherd\u2019s Flock** is a cultic group actively operating in the city, currently visible as **protesters at the gates** (CANON). They recruit vulnerable or \u201ctransformed\u201d individuals and fold them into a broader mission that frames violent or extreme acts as **necessary sacrifices for the greater good** (CANON + OBSERVED).\n\nThey explicitly **follow and answer to Maelthor** (OBSERVED: faction = followers of Maelthor), and their ideology centers on **Maelthor\u2019s influence and emergence** (OBSERVED). Their actions are justified as part of a cleansing process\u2014**purging impurities and promoting human supremacy** (CANON goals).\n\nPublicly, they disguise their activities as defensive or tragic necessity, but internally they are organized, symbolic, and tied to darker actions like **hiding corrupted meat** and marking bodies with their symbols (CANON relationship tags).\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Role: Cultists staging protests and recruiting\n- Allegiance: Followers of Maelthor\n- Goals: Recruitment, \u201ccleansing\u201d the world, advancing Maelthor\u2019s influence\n- Methods: Indoctrination, secrecy, manipulation of public perception\n- Presence: Active within the city, especially visible at protests",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
    {
      "id": "q_the_city_council_2",
