      "answer": "TL;DR: Torrin represents the Guilds (crafts/industry), Rurik oversees infrastructure and city structure, and Merril\u2019s council role is not defined in the provided context.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Torrin Flamescale (CANON + OBSERVED)\n  - Role: Representative of the Guilds; Master Smith\n  - Focus: Craft guilds, industry, practical city concerns\n  - Notes: Speaks bluntly on city issues; respected craftsman\n\n- Rurik Stonehammer (CANON + OBSERVED)\n  - Role: Representative of Infrastructure; Chief Architect\n  - Focus: Structural integrity, defenses, tunnels/sewers\n  - Notes: Deep knowledge of city layout; concerned with sealing cult access routes\n\n- Merril\n  - Role: Not specified in the projection\n  - Status: Insufficient information to determine council job based on current context\n\nNo conflicts are present for Torrin or Rurik\u2019s roles; both are consistent across CANON and OBSERVED facts. Merril is simply missing from the available data.",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
    {
      "id": "q_battle_with_the_wolf_and_aftermath_1",
