      "answer": "TL;DR: The Council Chambers were heavily disrupted\u2014hit by a Fireball, triggering magical defenses, and left generally disheveled.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Atmosphere (OBSERVED): \u201calmost the entire room is lit up by Fireball,\u201d indicating significant destructive magic used during Session 12.\n- Defenses (OBSERVED): Runes along the walls activated when Caelynn cast her spell, and Illusory Walls were active\u2014showing the chamber\u2019s magical defenses were triggered and visibly altered the space.\n- Physical Condition (OBSERVED): The room is explicitly described as \u201cDisheveled,\u201d reflecting damage and disorder from the encounter.\n- Geography (OBSERVED): No structural changes confirmed, but features like the large circular table and hidden trapdoor remained present.\n\nOverall, the biggest changes were magical activation (runes and illusions) and environmental damage from the Fireball, leaving the room in a visibly disturbed state.",
